       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 313-63
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="46257782"
    >
Regulations on hauling schedules.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-46257782" data-guid="46257782"></div>
        <div id="questions-46257782" data-guid="46257782" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="46257782_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Commissioner of General Services may establish rules and regulations necessary to coordinate the dates and geographic areas of permitted hauling schedules.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </main>
